sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Dashboard
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant DB as SQL Database<br/>SQLite / PostgreSQL
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>5000/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init
    participant S3 as S3 / Git / HuggingFace<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>8082/TCP
    participant EvalFW as Evaluation Framework<br/>lm-eval / RAGAS / etc.
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,EvalFW: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Submission (Kubernetes mode)

    Client->>Proxy: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Proxy->>Proxy: Validate token via RBAC
    Proxy->>API: Forward request<br/>X-User + X-Tenant headers
    API->>DB: Persist job record<br/>tenant-scoped
    API->>K8sAPI: Create Job + ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    API->>MLflow: Create experiment/run<br/>SA token auth
    API-->>Proxy: 201 Created (job ID)
    Proxy-->>Client: 201 Created

    Note over K8sAPI,EvalFW: Job Pod Lifecycle

    K8sAPI->>Init: Start init container
    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>AWS IAM / token
    S3-->>Init: Data artifacts
    Init-->>K8sAPI: Init complete

    K8sAPI->>EvalFW: Start evaluation container
    K8sAPI->>Sidecar: Start sidecar container

    EvalFW->>Sidecar: Status callbacks<br/>localhost:8082
    Sidecar->>API: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events<br/>HTTPS, SA token
    Sidecar->>MLflow: Log metrics/artifacts<br/>HTTP(S), SA token

    EvalFW-->>Sidecar: Evaluation complete
    Sidecar->>API: Final status event
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: Write termination message

    Note over Prom,API: Flow 2: Prometheus Metrics Scrape

    Prom->>API: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8081/TCP<br/>No auth
    API-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
